title: A Seat in the Zentrale
subtitle: Another current might vote with us, for a price.
view-if: congress = 1 and congress_closing = 0 and congress_used_trade = 0 and congress_has_trade_a = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.congress_used_trade = 1;
Q.sys_outcome = 0;
!}
frequency: 100
is-card: true
new-page: true
tags: congress

= A Seat in the Zentrale

In a back room of the congress hotel, someone from the [+ congress_trade_a_name +] has let it be known that their delegates are not bound by anything they said in public. [? if congress_has_trade_b = 1 : The [+ congress_trade_b_name +] are listening at the same door. ?]

A seat in the Zentrale is worth more than a speech. It is also a seat we will have to share afterwards, with people who will use it.

- @offer_a: Offer the [+ congress_trade_a_name +] a seat.
- @offer_b: Offer the [+ congress_trade_b_name +] a seat.
- @none: Keep the Zentrale whole.

@offer_a
subtitle: If they accept, their delegates vote with us. If we win, they share the Zentrale, and their red lines with it.
on-arrival: {!
if (Math.random() < 0.75) {
    Q.sys_outcome = 1;
    RG.congress.deal(Q.congress_trade_a);
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 3;
} else {
    Q.sys_outcome = 2;
    RG.congress.bitter(2);
}
!}

[? if sys_outcome = 1 : They accept. When the vote comes, the delegates of the [+ congress_trade_a_name +] will be with us. Our own people grumble about the price. ?][? if sys_outcome = 2 : They take the offer back to their caucus, and the caucus throws it out. By the evening the whole hall knows we tried. ?]

@offer_b
subtitle: If they accept, their delegates vote with us. If we win, they share the Zentrale, and their red lines with it.
view-if: congress_has_trade_b = 1
on-arrival: {!
if (Math.random() < 0.75) {
    Q.sys_outcome = 1;
    RG.congress.deal(Q.congress_trade_b);
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 3;
} else {
    Q.sys_outcome = 2;
    RG.congress.bitter(2);
}
!}

[? if sys_outcome = 1 : They accept. When the vote comes, the delegates of the [+ congress_trade_b_name +] will be with us. Our own people grumble about the price. ?][? if sys_outcome = 2 : They take the offer back to their caucus, and the caucus throws it out. By the evening the whole hall knows we tried. ?]

@none
subtitle: Our own current is proud of it.
on-arrival: {!
Q[Q.congress_backing + '_satisfaction'] += 3;
!}

We will win this on the argument, or not at all.
